<title>USA: S&amp;P SmallCap to add CompDent, Tencor</title>
<headline>S&amp;P SmallCap to add CompDent, Tencor</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Equity Investor Services Group of Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Thursday it will make two changes in the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 index next week.</p>
<p>CompDent Corp will replace AMTROL Inc after the close of trading on Tuesday and Tencor Instruments will replace Center Financial Corp on Wednesday.</p>
<p>AMTROL is being acquired by The Cypress Group investment partnership in a cash tender offer. Center Financial is being acquired in a stock swap by First Union Corp in a merger expected to close November 13.</p>
</text>
